<h2>Table of Contents</h2>
<div id="text-table-of-contents" role="doc-toc">
<ul>
<li><a href="#emacs-pastoral">What is the Emacs pastoral tradition?</a></li>
<li><a href="#useless">How doing useless work can be useful</a></li>
